&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a high-agency operator to work directly with the leadership team on &lt;strong&gt;high-impact cross-functional initiatives, including AI automation workflows.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll collaborate with leaders across &lt;strong&gt;Sales, Marketing, and Product&lt;/strong&gt; to drive cross-functional initiatives &lt;strong&gt;and build automation that scales the business.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage AI/automation workflows (Make.com, n8n, Claude, or similar) across business functions, replacing manual effort with systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional projects end-to-end, from scoping to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GTM and strategic initiatives with research, analysis, and structured thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across sales, marketing, and product teams to identify automation opportunities and ship solutions fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 - 6 years in GTM, consulting, or a founder&#39;s office role, with hands-on experience building automations or AI workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can hold their own with senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for action, comfortable with ambiguity, and wired to build systems rather than just manage tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
