&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Monitor CPL, CPQL, Cost per SQL, and CAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Support A/B testing and campaign optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Ensure regional performance visibility (US vs Rest of the World)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
