&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Own GA4 and website analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Optimize landing pages and conversion flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Execute technical and on-page SEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Implement AEO strategy for AI-driven search visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Track Organize traffic contribution to pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VI. Success Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate funnel reporting and attribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved conversion rates across lifecycle stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduced cost per SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-performing email automation engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurable organic pipeline contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean CRM and scalable marketing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
