&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; 4-6 years in marketing operations / performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Strong CRM expertise (salesforce, Zoho or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Hands-on experience with ABM and intent platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Experience with email automation platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Proficient in GA4, paid media tracking, SEO and AEO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Strong analytical and reporting skills&lt;/li&gt;
