&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated Software Development Engineer in Test 1/2 (SDET 1/2) to join our dynamic team at CloudSEK. As an SDET 1/2 you will play a crucial role in ensuring the quality and reliability of our cybersecurity products through the design and implementation of automated testing solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
